OL,3,GNEWSAMen jailed for jewellery shop
OL,4,Atunnel burglary plot
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree men who were caught trying to
OL,7,Ftunnel into a jewellery shop from a
OL,8,Fneighbouring massage parlour have been
OL,9,Fjailed for conspiracy to commit
OL,10,Fburglary.
OL,12,FIoan Asafeti, 39, Laurentiu-Daniel
OL,13,FNitisoara, 38, both of no fixed
OL,14,Faddress, and Sergiu Plastin, 42, of
OL,15,FPortadown, County Armagh, attempted to
OL,16,Fraid the shop on Mitcham Road in
OL,17,FTooting, south London, in the early
OL,18,Fhours of 17 July.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
