OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMen jailed for jewellery shop
OL,4,Atunnel burglary plot
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice said their arrests were part of
OL,7,Fa wider Flying Squad investigation that
OL,8,Funcovered an organised crime group
OL,9,Flinked to a string of jewellery shop
OL,10,Fbreak-ins in which goods worth over
OL,11,F#700,000 were taken.
OL,13,FThe men pleaded guilty in August to
OL,14,Fconspiracy to commit burglary with
OL,15,Fintent to steal and cause criminal
OL,16,Fdamage.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
